   <p>
    <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">I dare not</del><add place="above" seq="2">Let me not dare</add></subst> <add place="below" hand="#h02"><metamark target="#a001" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001">here or anywhere to</add> attempt
    any <del rend="overstrike">statement or</del> definition
    of Poetry,<del rend="overstrike"><gap extent="two units" reason="illegible"/></del><del rend="overstrike"><gap extent="one unit" reason="illegible"/></del>&#8212;<subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">or answering</del><add place="above" seq="2">nor answer</add></subst>
    the question <hi rend="tripleUnderline">W</hi>hat it is.
    Like Religion, Love,
    Nature, while <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the</del><add place="above" seq="2">these</add></subst> terms
    are indispensable and we <add place="above">all</add>
    give a sufficiently definite
    meaning to them <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">these</del><add place="below" rend="marked" seq="2"><metamark target="#a002" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002" seq="3">yet same as in their cases,</add></subst>
    <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">probably</del><add place="below" seq="2"><metamark target="#a003" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add xml:id="a003">perhaps as for them,</add> no defiition
    that has ever been made
    sufficiently encloses <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">them</del><add place="above" seq="2">the <unclear reason="illegible" cert="low" resp="#ja">name</unclear></add></subst>,
    nor <add place="above">can</add> any rule <del rend="overstrike">possibly
    made</del> or convention ever so
    <add place="above">absolutely</add> <unclear reason="illegible" resp="#ja" cert="low">obtuse</unclear> but some great
    exception may <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">resistlessly
    break through</del><add place="above" seq="2">arise and</add><add place="inline" seq="3">and <del rend="overstrike" seq="4"><gap extent="six units" reason="illegible"/></del> it</add></subst> <seg xml:id="alt001">overturn</seg><add place="above" xml:id="alt002">disregard <del rend="overstrike">it</del></add> <alt target="#alt001 #alt002"/>
    </p>
   

